Unit calculations, returns/gift cards, Party lifecycle, Party/asset integration, asset/quotation/reporting, and selected POS tests were executed. Unit, returns, Party, Party/asset, and reporting paths passed. POS checkout was fixture-blocked before business posting. Broad catalog, purchasing, inventory, and customer bundles were configuration/runtime blocked by long MariaDB setup rather than counted as product passes or failures.

