## Confidence verdict

**LOW.** The repository has meaningful passing focused evidence, but it does not yet support a high-confidence system-wide claim. The next level, MEDIUM, requires a clean current POS/shift end-to-end pass with exact financial and stock reconciliation, successful POS idempotency/oversell races, a completed authenticated browser pass for critical English/Arabic/mobile paths, and a completed affected regression. It also requires an explicit product decision or implementation for the missing offline capability and a documented treatment for the remaining partial flows.

The system must not be marked VERY HIGH because critical-flow completion, current reconciliation evidence, concurrency/idempotency evidence, current browser proof, and documented-flow parity are all incomplete.

